					<article id="post-33803" class="post-33803 page type-page status-publish hentry">
	<div class="content-inner">
		<header class="entry-header">
			<h1 class="title-post entry-title" >Our Venues</h1>		</header><!-- .entry-header -->

			

		<div class="entry-content" >
			<h2 style="text-align: center;">The Marsh San Francisco</h2>
<p><img fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-33810 alignleft" src="https://themarsh.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/IMG-5145-300x169.jpg" alt="" width="328" height="185" srcset="https://themarsh.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/IMG-5145-300x169.jpg 300w, https://themarsh.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/IMG-5145-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://themarsh.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/IMG-5145-768x432.jpg 768w, https://themarsh.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/IMG-5145-1536x864.jpg 1536w, https://themarsh.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/IMG-5145-2048x1152.jpg 2048w, https://themarsh.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/IMG-5145-500x281.jpg 500w, https://themarsh.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/IMG-5145-800x450.jpg 800w, https://themarsh.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/IMG-5145-1280x720.jpg 1280w, https://themarsh.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/IMG-5145-1920x1080.jpg 1920w, https://themarsh.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/IMG-5145-1000x563.jpg 1000w, https://themarsh.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/IMG-5145-230x129.jpg 230w, https://themarsh.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/IMG-5145-350x197.jpg 350w, https://themarsh.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/IMG-5145-480x270.jpg 480w" sizes="(max-width: 328px) 100vw, 328px" /></p>
<h3 style="text-align: center;"><strong>Mainstage</strong></h3>
<p>The San Francisco Mainstage is a 105 seat theater on the ground floor of the building. Concessions, including non-alcoholic drinks, are available for purchase inside the theater.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><img decoding="async" class="wp-image-33809 alignright" src="https://themarsh.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/IMG-5134-300x169.jpg" alt="" width="330" height="186" srcset="https://themarsh.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/IMG-5134-300x169.jpg 300w, https://themarsh.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/IMG-5134-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://themarsh.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/IMG-5134-768x432.jpg 768w, https://themarsh.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/IMG-5134-1536x864.jpg 1536w, https://themarsh.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/IMG-5134-2048x1152.jpg 2048w, https://themarsh.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/IMG-5134-500x281.jpg 500w, https://themarsh.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/IMG-5134-800x450.jpg 800w, https://themarsh.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/IMG-5134-1280x720.jpg 1280w, https://themarsh.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/IMG-5134-1920x1080.jpg 1920w, https://themarsh.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/IMG-5134-1000x563.jpg 1000w, https://themarsh.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/IMG-5134-230x129.jpg 230w, https://themarsh.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/IMG-5134-350x197.jpg 350w, https://themarsh.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/IMG-5134-480x270.jpg 480w" sizes="(max-width: 330px) 100vw, 330px" /></p>
<h3 style="text-align: center;"><strong>Studio Theater</strong></h3>
<p>The San Francisco Studio Theater is a 60-90 seat black box theater on the second floor of the building, accessible by stairs and elevator. Will call and concessions are located at The Marsh Cafe one door down from the Studio entrance on the ground floor.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<hr />
<h2 style="text-align: center;">The Marsh Berkeley</h2>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="wp-image-33839 size-medium alignleft" src="https://themarsh.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Berkeley-Theater-300x225.jpg" alt="" width="300" height="225" srcset="https://themarsh.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Berkeley-Theater-300x225.jpg 300w, https://themarsh.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Berkeley-Theater-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https://themarsh.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Berkeley-Theater-768x576.jpg 768w, https://themarsh.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Berkeley-Theater-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, https://themarsh.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Berkeley-Theater-2048x1536.jpg 2048w, https://themarsh.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Berkeley-Theater-500x375.jpg 500w, https://themarsh.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Berkeley-Theater-800x600.jpg 800w, https://themarsh.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Berkeley-Theater-1280x960.jpg 1280w, https://themarsh.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Berkeley-Theater-1920x1440.jpg 1920w, https://themarsh.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Berkeley-Theater-1000x750.jpg 1000w, https://themarsh.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Berkeley-Theater-230x173.jpg 230w, https://themarsh.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Berkeley-Theater-350x263.jpg 350w, https://themarsh.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Berkeley-Theater-480x360.jpg 480w" sizes="(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px" /></p>
<h3 style="text-align: center;"><strong>Theater</strong></h3>
<p>The Berkeley Theater is a 75-120 seat theater on the ground floor of the building. Additional seating is available on the Mezzanine level, accessible by stairs and elevator. Snacks and drinks from the Cabaret Bar are welcome inside the theater.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<h3></h3>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="wp-image-33838 size-medium alignright" src="https://themarsh.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Berkeley-Cabaret-300x225.jpg" alt="" width="300" height="225" srcset="https://themarsh.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Berkeley-Cabaret-300x225.jpg 300w, https://themarsh.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Berkeley-Cabaret-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https://themarsh.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Berkeley-Cabaret-768x576.jpg 768w, https://themarsh.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Berkeley-Cabaret-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, https://themarsh.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Berkeley-Cabaret-2048x1536.jpg 2048w, https://themarsh.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Berkeley-Cabaret-500x375.jpg 500w, https://themarsh.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Berkeley-Cabaret-800x600.jpg 800w, https://themarsh.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Berkeley-Cabaret-1280x960.jpg 1280w, https://themarsh.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Berkeley-Cabaret-1920x1440.jpg 1920w, https://themarsh.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Berkeley-Cabaret-1000x750.jpg 1000w, https://themarsh.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Berkeley-Cabaret-230x173.jpg 230w, https://themarsh.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Berkeley-Cabaret-350x263.jpg 350w, https://themarsh.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/Berkeley-Cabaret-480x360.jpg 480w" sizes="(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px" /></p>
<h3 style="text-align: center;"><strong>Cabaret</strong></h3>
<p>The Berkeley Cabaret is a 60 seat performance space with cabaret-style seating on the ground floor of the building. The Cabaret Bar is open both for Cabaret events and as the bar for shows in the theater.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<hr />
<h2 style="text-align: center;">COME JOIN US AT THE MARSH!</h2>
<p><iframe title="Come join us at The Marsh!" width="1170" height="658" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/ay2eUv5ttdI?feature=oembed" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen></iframe></p>
<hr />
<h2 style="text-align: center;">Rent The Marsh</h2>
<p>For more information about renting either of our venues, please <a href="https://themarsh.org/rental-pricing/">click here</a>.</p>
					</div><!-- .entry-content -->

		<footer class="entry-footer">
					</footer><!-- .entry-footer -->
	</div>
</article><!-- #post-## -->
	
						
					
